e interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Stimulants","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."}],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and dosage reference","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/4-HO-MET"},{"title":"TripSit Factsheet","description":"Rapid harm-reduction summary and combination data","url":"https://drugs.tripsit.me/4-ho-met"},{"title":"Erowid Experience Vaults","description":"First-person experience reports and archives","url":"https://www.erowid.org/experiences/subs/exp_4HOMET.shtml"},{"title":"TiHKAL Entry","description":"Alexander & Ann Shulgin tryptamine monograph","url":"https://www.erowid.org/library/books_online/tihkal/tihkal21.shtml"},{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/4-HO-MET"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on 4-HO-MET","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2090804"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/4-%E7%BE%9F%E5%9F%BA-N-%E7%94%B2%E5%9F%BA-N-%E4%B9%99%E5%9F%BA%E8%89%B2%E8%83%BA"},{"title":"维基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-cn/4-%E7%BE%9F%E5%9F%BA-N-%E7%94%B2%E5%9F%BA-N-%E4%B9%99%E5%9F%BA%E8%89%B2%E8%83%BA"}],"wikidata":"Q2090804","formula":"C13H18N2O","molarMass":218.29,"pharmacology":{"text":"4-HO-MET binds to various serotonin receptors and is known to act as an agonist of the serotonin 5-HT2A, 5-HT2B, 5-HT2C, and 5-HT1A receptors. It is thought that the hallucinogenic effects of serotonergic psychedelics like 4-HO-MET are mediated by serotonin 5-HT2A receptor activation.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"4-HO-MET","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/4-HO-MET#Pharmacodynamics","kind":"Non-selective serotonin receptor agonist; Serotonin 5-HT2A receptor agonist; Serotonergic psychedelic; Hallucinogen","figures":"4-HO-MET"},"uses":{"text":"The drug was encountered as a novel recreational and designer drug by 2008. It is openly sold as a legal recreational drug in the United States.","recreational":"Voyager Labs by Judd Weiss openly sells 4-HO-MET as a legal recreational drug in the United States as of the mid-2020s.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"4-HO-MET","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/4-HO-MET","routes":"Oral","figures":"4-HO-MET"},"summaryZh":"4-羥基-N-甲基-N-乙基色胺，又稱metocin或methylcybin，是一種屬於色胺衍生物和4-羥色胺家族的迷幻藥物，是賽洛新的結構類似物，也是N-甲基-N-乙基色胺的4-羥基類似物。該藥物是口服的。","summaryZhHans":"4-羟基-N-甲基-N-乙基色胺，又称metocin或methylcybin，是一种属于色胺衍生物和4-羟色胺家族的迷幻药物，是赛洛新的结构类似物，也是N-甲基-N-乙基色胺的4-羟基类似物。该药物是口服的。","ai":{"by":"Claude (Anthropic)","date":"2026-11-27","sideEffects":{"en":"Reported effects include nausea, yawning, dilated pupils, muscle tension, a faster heartbeat, anxiety, confusion and frightening experiences. In people at risk, it can trigger lasting mental health problems such as psychosis.","zh":"已知的反應包括噁心、打哈欠、瞳孔放大、肌肉緊繃、心跳加快、焦慮、意識混亂與驚恐的經驗。對本身有風險的人，可能誘發精神病等持久的心理健康問題。","zhHans":"已知的反应包括恶心、打哈欠、瞳孔放大、肌肉紧绷、心跳加快、焦虑、意识混乱与惊恐的经验。对本身有风险的人，可能诱发精神病等持久的心理健康问题。"},"fact":{"en":"It differs from psilocin by a single carbon atom: one of the two methyl groups on its nitrogen is replaced by an ethyl group. Alexander Shulgin described it in his book TiHKAL.","zh":"它和脫磷酸裸蓋菇素只差一個碳原子：氮原子上的兩個甲基中，有一個換成了乙基。Alexander Shulgin在著作《TiHKAL》中描述過它。","zhHans":"它和脱磷酸裸盖菇素只差一个碳原子：氮原子上的两个甲基中，有一个换成了乙基。Alexander Shulgin在著作《TiHKAL》中描述过它。"}}}